      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ritual Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sorcerer\r\u0022Master! Strange occult forces are at work here... A ritual is pulling demons forth to attack us! We must close that infernal gate...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105UN0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 1 Drama",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor\n\u0022Our scouts have scoured the surroundings for the Undead...none of their forces could be found.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bethrezen\n\u0022That there are no Undead on these lands is obvious...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor\n\u0022What do you mean, Master Bethrezen? Have we not come to this place to ambush them!?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022I am not Bethrezen...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Counselor\n\u0022Not Bethrezen!? But you have been acting as Bethrezen...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022You will understand soon enough... Asteroth! Crush these demons of the lower planes. We have no use for them any longer, have we?!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 1-2 Drama",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Asteroth\n\u0022Yes, we shall rule together! They will not be able to defy us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Destroy the demon lord Asteroth",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 1-3 Drama",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Abyssal Devil \n\u0022Servant demons...We have no need of you!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Abyssal Devil \n\u0022We stand by the our true master Bethrezen! He will make you pay for your betrayal...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Gromdam Text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Marksman \n\u0022Do you not know when to quit, Demons? Uther will rule the lands, and you will be forced to stand aside!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Rottudam Text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Knight \n\u0022Stay back, Demons! We await our savior Uther... when he arrives, we will repay you for your trespasses!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105UN002a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Onyx Gargoyle",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
